flowchart LR
    P[Partially verified Supervisor] --> Q[Build existing alternate official-source query]
    Q --> S[Run the existing bounded search once]
    S --> O{Provider outcome}
    O -->|Not configured| NC[Record not_configured]
    O -->|Typed error| PE[Record provider_error category]
    O -->|Results| G[Apply selector gates in fixed order]

    G --> QM[Originating-query match]
    QM --> SU[Different from primary URL]
    SU --> HH[Valid HTTPS and hostname]
    HH --> PN[Exact person text]
    PN --> IN[Exact institution text]
    IN --> SR[Singular person-profile route]
    SR --> AH[Matching academic host]
    AH --> SK[Supported official source kind]

    QM -. first failure .-> R[Increment one typed rejection count]
    SU -. first failure .-> R
    HH -. first failure .-> R
    PN -. first failure .-> R
    IN -. first failure .-> R
    SR -. first failure .-> R
    AH -. first failure .-> R
    SK -. first failure .-> R
    SK -->|Eligible| F[Count eligible result and retain first source]

    R --> A[Build rejected_all or selected attempt]
    F --> A
    O -->|Zero results| Z[Record no_results]
    NC --> C[Checkpoint replay-safe AlternateSourceAttempt]
    PE --> C
    A --> C
    Z --> C
    F --> E[Existing alternate extraction retry]

    C --> U[Aggregate current discovery round]
    U --> V[Streamlit counts and first-failed-gate breakdown]
    X[Queries, result text, URLs, identities, page content, Candidate content, secrets] -. omitted .-> V
